DESCRIPTION:The Greater Gulf State Fair fills the Mobile fairgrounds for t
 en days with a midway of rides\, a rodeo\, a community stage and a pickin
  porch. It is the largest fair in the Mobile area and a good outing for a
  family that wants a full evening of rides and fair food. Children 4 and 
 under do not need an admission ticket\, though they do need a wristband t
 o ride. General admission and ride prices are not printed on the fair's p
 ages\, so check the ticket store before driving over.\nPrice: not publish
